OL,7,G0855 Four in a Bed
OL,8,     FThe week kicks off in
OL,9,     FMonmouthshire, South Wales, at
OL,10,     FKenny and Ben's Creates Monmouth
OL,11,     FB&B. The guests are wowed by the
OL,12,     Fwild interiors, but one of them
OL,13,     Fworries about a lack of privacy.
OL,14,G0930 Four in a Bed
OL,15,     FVisit two is to Coastal Park
OL,16,     FAccommodation in Llanelli, run by
OL,17,     FClaire. Some cleanliness concerns
OL,18,     Fleave one pair of guests
OL,19,     Fquibbling, and there's a fiery
OL,20,     Fexchange over evening drinks.
